&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;(ストック・オプション等関係)&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;"&gt;１．ストック・オプション及び譲渡制限付株式報酬にかかる費用計上額及び科目名&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:14pt;font-size:14pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
